  "transcript": [
    {
      "approx_t": 0,
      "text": "You've done it in the mirror. Pulled the skin back at your temples. Lifted your cheek with two fingers. Held it there. Let go. A guess you make with your hands and finish in your head."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 17,
      "text": "So we built Refina. Upload one photo. Choose the procedure you're considering. And see it rendered on your own face."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 30,
      "text": "Three things change once you can see it. First, you stop guessing."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 47,
      "text": "Second, you find out what you don't want. Ruling a procedure out is an answer too, and it costs you nothing."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 56,
      "text": "And third, you decide before anyone is selling to you. At home. On your own time. Not across a desk from someone with a price list and a waiting room."
    },
    {
      "approx_t": 68.0,
      "text": "Refina is a preview, not a promise. Your surgeon determines your result. But you should get to see it before you spend another year imagining it."
    }
  ],
